WEBVTT

00:01:52.130 --> 00:01:54.590
You the Dark Lord?

00:01:57.430 --> 00:02:00.600
Allow me ta introduce myself!

00:02:00.600 --> 00:02:04.600
I'm a black dragon from the
Onyx Mountains. Th'name's Varney!

00:02:04.600 --> 00:02:11.530
I'm pleased and humbled ta meetcha and
hope you'll remember me down the line!

00:02:12.860 --> 00:02:13.740
Excuse me?

00:02:13.740 --> 00:02:17.490
"Excuse me," my dragon ass!
I'm tryin' ta make your acquaintance!

00:02:17.490 --> 00:02:20.240
You're supposed ta be all like
"the pleasure is all mine" and shit!

00:02:20.240 --> 00:02:22.500
I'd argue that's a bit much
in this day and age.

