00:02:27.920 --> 00:02:32.970
I went outta my way to be proper
and polite for the Dark Lord 'n all.

00:02:28.000 --> 00:02:32.880
"Polite Introductions for Dummiez"

00:02:32.970 --> 00:02:34.630
You not him or something?

00:02:34.630 --> 00:02:37.140
Seems like he has business
with the Dark Lord.

00:02:37.140 --> 00:02:39.390
But he also sounds like a heap of trouble,

00:02:39.390 --> 00:02:42.810
so I'll just convince him to leave.

00:02:42.810 --> 00:02:45.980
Let's take a looksie.

00:02:45.980 --> 00:02:47.520
Yeah, that looks like you, all right!

00:02:47.520 --> 00:02:49.520
You have the wrong man.

00:02:49.520 --> 00:02:53.190
Take a close look at me.
I'm nothing like that picture.

00:02:53.190 --> 00:02:54.650
You sure?

00:02:54.650 --> 00:02:57.320
Not like I can tell you two-leggies apart.

00:02:57.320 --> 00:03:00.330
You humans and elves all look the same.

00:03:00.330 --> 00:03:02.080
Why bother with a picture, then?

00:03:02.080 --> 00:03:06.420
Well, whatever. The Dark Lord Agency
guys sent me this way for a reason.

00:03:06.420 --> 00:03:08.670
You gotta be him.

00:03:08.670 --> 00:03:10.920
I need your help with somethin'.

00:03:12.000 --> 00:03:15.550
I see. Let me introduce myself
before we proceed.

00:03:15.550 --> 00:03:18.220
My name is Dearia.

00:03:18.220 --> 00:03:21.470
Sweet. Like I said before,
the name's Varney.

00:03:21.470 --> 00:03:24.270
As ya can tell, I'm a black dragon.

00:03:24.270 --> 00:03:27.270
My perfect woman's got a long,
sexy tail and sharp, pretty claws--

00:03:27.270 --> 00:03:29.860
I don't recall asking you
for your preference in women.

00:03:29.860 --> 00:03:32.020
I've heard of you before, I believe.

00:03:32.020 --> 00:03:35.740
Are you the Mighty Dark Dragon upon
whom the Heroes have placed a bounty?

00:03:35.740 --> 00:03:37.110
That's me!

00:03:37.110 --> 00:03:41.160
I'm the dreadwyrm that builds mountains
outta the coprses of Heroes!

00:03:41.160 --> 00:03:46.040
Sometimes I'm burnin' the countryside,
sometimes I'm lurkin' in labyrinths!

00:03:46.040 --> 00:03:51.090
If I hear the Mighty Dark Dragon's been
spotted somewhere, that's where I'm goin'!

00:03:51.090 --> 00:03:55.550
That's the Mighty Dark
Dragon's creed, ya dig?

00:03:55.550 --> 00:03:57.510
You follow the rumors,
not the other way around?

00:03:57.510 --> 00:04:02.050
Well, duh. Would be a letdown if they're
expectin' me to be around, yeah?

00:04:02.050 --> 00:04:05.100
And you're concerned about that <i>why</i>?

00:04:05.100 --> 00:04:08.640
What is it that you desire of me?

00:04:11.060 --> 00:04:12.650
I need me...

00:04:12.650 --> 00:04:14.440
...some primo property!

00:04:15.900 --> 00:04:17.690
Property?

00:04:17.690 --> 00:04:22.660
I'm terribly sorry, but I'm afraid
I'm the wrong man to ask.

00:04:22.660 --> 00:04:25.870
I'd recommend visiting a
real estate agent, a dwarven artisan,

00:04:25.870 --> 00:04:27.660
or consulting with your
local social services office--

00:04:27.660 --> 00:04:29.670
The hell you just say?

00:04:29.670 --> 00:04:34.170
I talk to you all humble-like, and you
tell me to piss off like some newt?

00:04:34.170 --> 00:04:35.590
You're the Demon Lord,
for cryin' out loud!

00:04:35.590 --> 00:04:39.170
Can'tcha wiggle your fingers
and magic a house into existence?

00:04:39.170 --> 00:04:42.300
Is this really how you ask
someone to help you?

00:04:42.300 --> 00:04:44.430
You don't like my attitude?

00:04:44.430 --> 00:04:46.600
Your attitude isn't the problem.

00:04:46.600 --> 00:04:49.980
Fine, try this on for size!

00:04:49.980 --> 00:04:55.150
I want a house! Gimme, gimme!
Gimme a house, c'mon! How'zis?

00:04:55.150 --> 00:04:57.820
He's missing the point!

00:04:57.820 --> 00:05:02.070
My, you've brought me yet another
interesting acquaintance.

00:05:03.660 --> 00:05:04.530
Master!

00:05:04.530 --> 00:05:06.200
Damn, she's huge!

00:05:06.200 --> 00:05:08.700
You should provide him
with your assistance.

00:05:08.700 --> 00:05:11.000
Why me, Master?

00:05:11.000 --> 00:05:17.050
He came all this way to ask
for your help and your help alone.

00:05:17.050 --> 00:05:18.880
If you are to be my apprentice,

00:05:18.880 --> 00:05:23.470
then you should lend a helping hand
to those who request it.

00:05:24.510 --> 00:05:26.850
Hell yeah! And it'll be
great experience for ya!

00:05:26.850 --> 00:05:29.220
You stay out of this.

00:05:30.270 --> 00:05:31.390
Very well, then.

00:05:31.390 --> 00:05:33.850
Whoa, you in, then?

00:05:33.850 --> 00:05:36.610
Dark Dragon.

00:05:36.610 --> 00:05:39.690
Do treat him kindly.

00:05:39.690 --> 00:05:44.660
There is so much he has yet to learn.

00:05:44.660 --> 00:05:48.790
No problem, lady!
I'll train 'im good and hard!

00:05:48.790 --> 00:05:50.290
C'mon, let's get rollin'!

00:05:50.290 --> 00:05:52.920
Save travels to you both.

00:05:59.170 --> 00:06:02.090
So, why are we here?

00:06:02.090 --> 00:06:05.340
Whaddya mean, why?
We're lookin' for prime real estate!

00:06:05.340 --> 00:06:08.350
If the Dark Lord can't
conjure me up a house,

00:06:08.350 --> 00:06:12.310
then we got no choice but
to repossess one for me, yeah?

00:06:12.310 --> 00:06:13.810
What a pain.

00:06:13.810 --> 00:06:18.860
You could also earn money
to pay for a custom-built house.

00:06:18.860 --> 00:06:20.940
Eh, maybe next time.

00:06:20.940 --> 00:06:24.030
More importantly, this is
a Hero Guild fortress, is it not?

00:06:24.030 --> 00:06:26.120
Yeah, just one of 'em.

00:06:26.120 --> 00:06:31.580
Don't think anyone'd mind
if I took it off their dumb little hands.

00:06:31.580 --> 00:06:35.290
My, so you <i>do </i>have some understanding
of the concept of "concern for others."

00:06:35.290 --> 00:06:37.130
You cruisin' for a bruisin'?

00:06:37.130 --> 00:06:39.630
If you'd planned on attacking
a Hero Guild all along,

00:06:39.630 --> 00:06:42.550
then why do you need me?

00:06:42.550 --> 00:06:46.430
This should be quite easy for someone as
renowned as you, the Mighty Dark Dragon.

00:06:46.430 --> 00:06:48.970
I'll take my leave, then.

00:06:48.970 --> 00:06:50.470
The hell're you doin'?

00:06:50.470 --> 00:06:54.350
Thought your Master told ya to help
me out. You just gonna disobey 'er?

00:06:54.430 --> 00:06:55.310
FREEZE

00:06:55.770 --> 00:06:58.560
Or does the Dark Lord not have the
<i>cajones </i>to fight some itty-bitty heroes?

00:06:58.560 --> 00:07:02.190
Yeesh, talk about a maroon.

00:06:58.680 --> 00:06:59.850
Cajones...?

00:07:00.440 --> 00:07:01.600
Maroon...?

00:07:02.190 --> 00:07:05.530
Fine, I'll go tell your
Master you ain't helpin'.

00:07:05.530 --> 00:07:07.530
Very well, I'll help you...

00:07:07.530 --> 00:07:12.200
...if you tell me the meanings
of "<i>cajones</i>" and "maroon."

00:07:12.200 --> 00:07:14.200
I know they are hardly compliments.

00:07:14.200 --> 00:07:16.620
Damn, you're the type
to hold grudges, ain'tcha?

00:07:19.420 --> 00:07:22.300
We're commencing our attack head-on?

00:07:22.300 --> 00:07:24.550
A surprise aerial attack
would seem more prudent.

00:07:24.550 --> 00:07:26.760
Don't be stupid.

00:07:27.800 --> 00:07:30.050
When you're swingin' by for a visit,

00:07:30.050 --> 00:07:33.640
it's good manners to knock!

00:07:34.850 --> 00:07:36.940
Anybody home?!

00:07:36.940 --> 00:07:37.770
What the...

00:07:37.770 --> 00:07:39.230
A dragon?!

00:07:39.230 --> 00:07:41.900
Not just any dragon!

00:07:41.900 --> 00:07:45.690
The Mighty Dark Dragon himself!

00:07:45.690 --> 00:07:49.620
I don't got any interest in barbecuin'
cute girlies! Go on, get outta here!

00:07:49.620 --> 00:07:51.450
That bein' said...

00:07:53.700 --> 00:07:56.790
You boys aren't goin' anywhere!

00:08:08.180 --> 00:08:09.930
Falter not, Heroes!

00:08:09.930 --> 00:08:12.970
We need but fight as one!

00:08:12.970 --> 00:08:15.890
When he's dead,
his mats are ours to share!

00:08:15.890 --> 00:08:17.230
Attack!

00:08:21.940 --> 00:08:23.320
You ain't bad.

00:08:26.530 --> 00:08:27.740
Why wouldn't I be?

00:08:27.740 --> 00:08:32.700
We won't give up!

00:08:32.700 --> 00:08:37.540
We're Heroes! The hope of the people!
Those who right the world's wrongs!

00:08:37.540 --> 00:08:40.080
We are the gods of the new world!

00:08:40.080 --> 00:08:41.630
That's a bit of a stretch.

00:08:41.630 --> 00:08:44.500
Then I'm gonna make the gods my bitch!

00:08:44.500 --> 00:08:45.920
Don't stoop to their level.

00:08:45.920 --> 00:08:51.090
Why the hell not?! Fightin's not just
about fists, it's about heart, too!

00:08:51.090 --> 00:08:54.600
He's right! So right!

00:08:52.550 --> 00:08:54.600
How am I the bad guy here?

00:08:54.600 --> 00:08:57.560
If this charade is that important,
then by all means, continue.

00:08:57.560 --> 00:09:00.480
Don't be such a stick
in the mud, Dark Lord.

00:09:00.480 --> 00:09:01.940
The Dark Lord?!

00:09:01.940 --> 00:09:03.730
Impossible!

00:09:03.730 --> 00:09:08.570
I thought he was no more than legend!
No one has seen him in centuries!

00:09:08.570 --> 00:09:10.780
You got legends about you?

00:09:10.780 --> 00:09:12.610
Apparently.

00:09:12.610 --> 00:09:15.950
The Legendary Dark Lord or the
Mighty Dark Dragon... Who sounds cooler?

00:09:15.950 --> 00:09:17.160
Does that really matter?

00:09:17.160 --> 00:09:20.120
It doesn't matter who or what you are!

00:09:20.120 --> 00:09:22.670
We'll send you both into eternal slumber!

00:09:29.300 --> 00:09:31.380
Hey, Dark Lord!

00:09:31.380 --> 00:09:33.180
You havin' fun?

00:09:33.180 --> 00:09:35.550
What part of this situation is fun?

00:09:35.550 --> 00:09:38.850
It ain't about the situation!

00:09:38.850 --> 00:09:40.930
It's about enjoyin' yourself!

00:09:40.930 --> 00:09:42.810
Might as well have fun
while you're workin', yeah?

00:09:42.810 --> 00:09:45.400
If you say so.

00:09:45.400 --> 00:09:47.110
No matter what happens to ya,

00:09:47.110 --> 00:09:49.780
as long as you had the most fun,
you're the real winner in the end!

00:09:53.280 --> 00:09:54.990
I can't say I follow.

