00:10:02.160 --> 00:10:04.830
Damn, that was a boatload of fun!

00:10:04.830 --> 00:10:10.590
Since this fortress is now your home,
I'll be taking my leave--

00:10:10.590 --> 00:10:14.890
Man, I wanna check out
a property by the beach next!

00:10:14.890 --> 00:10:16.720
A'ight, let's mosey, Dark Lord!

00:10:16.720 --> 00:10:19.140
Did you hear a word I just said?

00:10:19.140 --> 00:10:22.980
What do you mean, "next"?
Is this not your new home?

00:10:22.980 --> 00:10:25.940
Tsk, tsk, tsk.

00:10:25.940 --> 00:10:29.980
House huntin' ain't no cakewalk.

00:10:29.980 --> 00:10:34.240
How you gonna suss out a house if you
ain't gone inside and looked around?

00:10:34.240 --> 00:10:35.700
Like here, lookit this.

00:10:35.700 --> 00:10:37.320
The door you smashed?

00:10:37.320 --> 00:10:41.200
I can't be livin' in a house where
a single knock breaks down the door!

00:10:41.200 --> 00:10:43.040
If you knew that, why did
we have to fight them?!

00:10:43.040 --> 00:10:46.040
A'ight, let's head out
to see the next one.

00:10:46.040 --> 00:10:49.090
Wait, how many properties
do you plan on viewing?

00:10:49.090 --> 00:10:54.430
The hell should I know? I'll be done
when I find the one, ya dummy.

00:10:54.430 --> 00:10:56.720
That was unnecessary.

00:10:56.720 --> 00:10:59.140
I truly despise people like you.

00:10:59.140 --> 00:11:04.060
Hey, perfect! I hate me some
pretentious eggheads, too!

00:11:04.060 --> 00:11:05.390
You big, arrogant lizard!

00:11:05.390 --> 00:11:10.940
And so, my hundred-year house hunt
with the black dragon began.

00:11:10.940 --> 00:11:13.860
The next morning, at a church...

00:11:15.900 --> 00:11:18.570
--Wh-What the...
--Damn you, Dark Lord...

00:11:28.830 --> 00:11:31.130
The hell is this?!

00:11:31.130 --> 00:11:33.710
What's gotten into you?
Must you be so loud?

00:11:33.710 --> 00:11:34.720
Ah, a news bulletin?

00:11:34.720 --> 00:11:37.800
I just found it on the main road!

00:11:37.800 --> 00:11:41.010
"Multiple Hero Guilds Attacked."

00:11:37.880 --> 00:11:43.340
The Dark Lord Returns

00:11:37.880 --> 00:11:43.340
The Dark Lord Returns

00:11:41.010 --> 00:11:43.350
"Has the Dark Lord Returned?"

00:11:43.350 --> 00:11:45.430
Seems we're talk of the town.

00:11:45.430 --> 00:11:48.270
They're all talkin' about
you more than me!

00:11:48.270 --> 00:11:50.940
What do you want me to do about it?

00:11:50.940 --> 00:11:53.940
I'll just send 'em a letter sayin'
<i>I'm </i>the one attackin' everyone!

00:11:53.940 --> 00:11:57.320
I thought you wanted
to find a home, not fame.

00:11:57.320 --> 00:12:01.830
We've viewed a number of properties,
but you've liked none of them.

00:12:01.830 --> 00:12:03.580
This search has been
a giant waste of time.

00:12:03.580 --> 00:12:08.040
How'm I supposed to like 'em when
the doors break or the floors cave in?!

00:12:08.040 --> 00:12:10.380
I have a suggestion.

00:12:10.380 --> 00:12:12.420
Let us test a variety
of building materials

00:12:12.420 --> 00:12:15.590
to see which can withstand
a dragon's occupancy.

00:12:15.590 --> 00:12:16.970
Oh, <i>now </i>you're thinkin' smart?

00:12:16.970 --> 00:12:22.180
I'm sorry, my specialization
isn't in construction.

00:12:22.180 --> 00:12:24.680
So how're we gonna test stuff?

00:12:24.680 --> 00:12:30.400
I'll have you walk and jump upon various
materials to measure their durability.

00:12:30.400 --> 00:12:35.780
Let me ask a few acquaintances of mine
to procure those materials for us.

00:12:35.780 --> 00:12:38.200
No need for that, man.

00:12:38.200 --> 00:12:41.200
We'll just make the Heroes "help"!

00:12:41.200 --> 00:12:45.790
Then the next headlines'll all be
about me, the Mighty Dark Dragon!

00:12:45.790 --> 00:12:47.830
You're still upset about that?

00:12:51.380 --> 00:12:53.670
You hear that rumor about
the Dark Lord returning?

00:12:53.670 --> 00:12:56.170
Our base might end up attacked, too.

00:12:56.170 --> 00:12:58.840
We'll be fine. Unlike the other bases,
this one was built by dwarven architects.

00:12:58.840 --> 00:13:02.510
The fortress is impenetrable!
Not even a dragon or a Dark Lord could--

00:13:09.730 --> 00:13:13.230
A single sweep of your tail
destroyed the outer walls.

00:13:14.230 --> 00:13:18.650
Is this reinforced brick?
No matter, it's not very durable.

00:13:18.650 --> 00:13:21.860
I'd heard this was dwarven work,
but from the quality of construction,

00:13:21.860 --> 00:13:24.910
I'd fathom the budget for
this fortress was quite low.

00:13:24.910 --> 00:13:26.160
Who is this guy?!

00:13:26.160 --> 00:13:28.830
C'mon, Dark Lord, let's hit the next one!

00:13:28.830 --> 00:13:30.540
Very well.

00:13:30.540 --> 00:13:32.830
Thank you for your cooperation. Farewell.

00:13:32.830 --> 00:13:34.040
Bye, nerds!

00:13:38.010 --> 00:13:39.880
What?

00:13:39.880 --> 00:13:42.590
Heard Hart Fortress got attacked.

00:13:42.590 --> 00:13:44.930
By the Dark Lord and
a black dragon, no less.

00:13:44.930 --> 00:13:48.020
Strangely, all they did was break
a hole in the wall, then fly away.

00:13:48.020 --> 00:13:50.020
What are they plotting?

00:13:54.480 --> 00:13:56.400
The roof!

00:13:56.400 --> 00:13:59.860
Oh, that ain't cuttin' it.
Build a stronger roof, fellas!

00:13:59.860 --> 00:14:04.870
We may want to test if a heavier roof
is more earthquake-resistant, too.

00:14:04.870 --> 00:14:07.580
Mmkay, next!

00:14:07.580 --> 00:14:09.410
Later, haters!

00:14:09.410 --> 00:14:11.540
What the hell did you want from us?!

00:14:11.540 --> 00:14:14.460
Next, let's test for fire resistance.

00:14:17.960 --> 00:14:20.210
It burns!

00:14:22.510 --> 00:14:26.510
Not even marble can withstand
your fire breath... Noted.

00:14:28.720 --> 00:14:32.560
Ain't nothin' out there that
can withstand my fire breath!

00:14:32.560 --> 00:14:34.650
I would hope that you're wrong,

00:14:34.650 --> 00:14:37.520
else finding you a home
will be more difficult.

00:14:54.830 --> 00:15:00.550
Thanks to the Heroes' kind help,
we finally have our information.

00:15:00.550 --> 00:15:03.970
It is nigh-impossible for a dragon
to live in a home built for humans.

00:15:03.970 --> 00:15:05.970
Yeah, figured that out early.

00:15:05.970 --> 00:15:07.300
As did I.

00:15:07.300 --> 00:15:12.470
I believe you'll need a large-scale
property built for non-humans.

00:15:12.470 --> 00:15:17.480
I don't wanna steal from a non-human,
though. Goes against my moral code.

00:15:17.480 --> 00:15:19.230
Right, then.

00:15:19.230 --> 00:15:24.320
Your safest option would be to offer
a large sum of money to dwarven builders.

00:15:24.320 --> 00:15:27.490
They're responsible for most of
the world's architectural wonders.

00:15:27.490 --> 00:15:34.910
Budget permitting, I'm sure you could
have them construct you a suitable home.

00:15:34.910 --> 00:15:37.170
You bein' serious right now?

00:15:37.170 --> 00:15:41.550
That's our gold. Damn dragon.
We'll skin ya alive.

00:15:38.250 --> 00:15:41.550
Dwarves hate dragons.

00:15:41.550 --> 00:15:43.630
I don't even got me a hoard,

00:15:43.630 --> 00:15:47.010
but I still wouldn't mess with 'em
unless I was lookin' to die.

00:15:47.010 --> 00:15:50.600
Besides, dwarves are
so goddamn greedy, y'know?

00:15:50.600 --> 00:15:54.430
I do know they have a great
fondness for precious metals.

00:15:54.430 --> 00:15:58.440
Wait, you sayin' you've
never met one before?

00:15:58.440 --> 00:16:00.560
I've never even spoken to one.

00:16:00.560 --> 00:16:06.280
Well, sheesh. S'like you just read the
cover of a book and said you read it.

00:16:06.280 --> 00:16:09.570
It's kinda like you don't
really know anything.

00:16:11.830 --> 00:16:13.830
That's absurd.

00:16:13.830 --> 00:16:17.710
Eh, it's fine. Not like I have
the money to hire dwarves, anywho.

00:16:17.710 --> 00:16:19.630
Upsie daisy.

00:16:22.040 --> 00:16:26.050
Hey, Dark Lord, was there always
a Hero guild out this ways?

00:16:26.050 --> 00:16:27.840
That's a Hero flag, ain't it?

00:16:27.840 --> 00:16:31.470
I couldn't say.
It's certainly not on the map.

00:16:31.470 --> 00:16:33.850
Perhaps it was built recently?

00:16:35.310 --> 00:16:37.350
Well, then, let's go pay 'em a visit.

00:16:37.350 --> 00:16:40.940
Why? We've finished
our testing, have we not?

00:16:40.940 --> 00:16:42.900
Test, schmest!

00:16:42.900 --> 00:16:44.690
We're goin' anyway!

00:16:44.690 --> 00:16:45.780
What?!

00:16:52.660 --> 00:16:54.910
Knock, knock, boys!

00:16:54.910 --> 00:16:57.750
Heeeeeere's Varney!

00:16:57.750 --> 00:17:00.670
--A dragon?!
--A dragon!
--Boom, baby! It's the Dark Dragon!

00:17:02.500 --> 00:17:05.670
Why all this ruckus? Goodness, gracious...

00:17:05.670 --> 00:17:08.840
I'm gonna wreck this joint!
C'mon, lend me a hand!

00:17:08.840 --> 00:17:12.720
But why? You certainly
don't want to live here.

00:17:12.720 --> 00:17:16.720
I saw some teeny-tiny
non-humans hangin' around here.

00:17:16.720 --> 00:17:21.270
Don't want 'em livin' under
the threat of Heroes all the time.

00:17:21.270 --> 00:17:23.770
So I'mma wreck it!

00:17:23.770 --> 00:17:25.650
Wait just a moment.

00:17:25.650 --> 00:17:30.400
You don't know if those non-humans
live here or were only passing through.

00:17:30.400 --> 00:17:32.160
Oh, shut it, elf boyo!

00:17:32.160 --> 00:17:34.070
Quit your yappin' and
make with the smashin'!

00:17:34.070 --> 00:17:36.160
Can't believe you're this stupid!

00:17:36.160 --> 00:17:38.660
C'mon, moron! Get to work, baldy!

00:17:38.660 --> 00:17:42.960
An elf and a black dragon...
you must be the Dark Lord!

00:17:48.210 --> 00:17:51.090
All this time, I've held my tongue.

00:17:51.090 --> 00:17:53.260
A homeless beggar like you,
who forced himself into my care,

00:17:53.260 --> 00:17:57.060
has no right to be
so arrogant and insulting!

00:17:57.060 --> 00:17:57.840
Oh, yeah?!

00:17:57.840 --> 00:18:00.140
The only reason I have stayed with you
is because I have no choice!

00:18:00.140 --> 00:18:01.730
You wanna go, egghead?!

00:18:01.730 --> 00:18:05.190
Big words from some twerp who
keeps bawling about his "maaaaster"!

00:18:05.190 --> 00:18:08.860
If you think that poorly of me, then use
your tiny brain to find your own home!

00:18:08.860 --> 00:18:10.320
You selfish, wild beast!

00:18:10.320 --> 00:18:13.610
I don't need help from some kid
still suckin' at his momma's teat!

00:18:11.530 --> 00:18:13.610
No idea what's going on,

00:18:13.610 --> 00:18:16.080
but if they're fighting each other,
now's our chance!

00:18:17.950 --> 00:18:20.000
--Shut it!
--Silence!

00:18:20.000 --> 00:18:25.500
You're just using non-humans as
an excuse to stand out, aren't you?!

00:18:30.170 --> 00:18:31.670
So what if I am?!

00:18:31.670 --> 00:18:35.840
If the Heroes are payin' attention to me,
they ain't hurtin' the small fry!

00:18:35.840 --> 00:18:38.970
That's what we gotta do
at the top of the food chain!

00:18:38.970 --> 00:18:42.770
It's a matter of pride!

00:18:42.770 --> 00:18:44.390
What about you, huh?!

00:18:44.390 --> 00:18:46.140
You ain't got nothin' you wanna protect!

00:18:46.140 --> 00:18:46.770
I haven't time for--

00:18:46.770 --> 00:18:50.530
Ya can't come up with nothin'
'cause you don't <i>know </i>nothin'!

00:18:50.530 --> 00:18:52.530
You need to take a better look...

00:18:52.530 --> 00:18:54.410
...at the world ya live in!

00:18:56.530 --> 00:19:00.160
There is so much he has yet to learn.

00:19:11.920 --> 00:19:16.720
I'd like to ask you a question
to learn more about you.

00:19:16.720 --> 00:19:21.810
What's this about, huh?
You never ask about me.

00:19:21.810 --> 00:19:26.730
You told me to take a better
look at the world around me.

00:19:26.730 --> 00:19:29.480
Well, shit. Finally see
how awesome I am, then?

00:19:29.480 --> 00:19:33.490
Sure, ask away. I'll tell ya
about all my glorious deeds!

00:19:33.490 --> 00:19:35.320
I'm not interested in those.

00:19:35.320 --> 00:19:39.370
Why is it you want your own home?

00:19:41.370 --> 00:19:45.370
Why? Well, how do I put it...

00:19:45.370 --> 00:19:47.210
I want...

00:19:47.210 --> 00:19:49.540
You want what?

00:19:49.540 --> 00:19:52.210
I want a family.

00:19:52.210 --> 00:19:56.220
I'm gettin' on in years,
so it's about time I got me a wife.

00:19:56.220 --> 00:20:01.560
Girl dragons won't give a guy the time
of day if he don't have his own turf.

00:20:01.560 --> 00:20:05.180
And even though I'm such a catch,
I keep runnin' into this other problem.

00:20:04.720 --> 00:20:10.680
"NO SOLICITORS"

00:20:05.180 --> 00:20:11.520
Whenever I try ta settle down,
the Heroes come knockin' at my door.

00:20:11.520 --> 00:20:13.690
It's hard bein' so damn popular.

00:20:13.690 --> 00:20:16.070
I'd say it's more due
to the bounty on your head.

00:20:16.070 --> 00:20:19.620
So you'd like a place you can bring
women back to without worrying.

00:20:19.620 --> 00:20:22.450
Couldja rephrase that?

00:20:22.450 --> 00:20:23.740
You'd like a love nest for making babies.

00:20:23.740 --> 00:20:24.910
Woof, never mind.

00:20:24.910 --> 00:20:28.080
But why come to me?

00:20:28.080 --> 00:20:33.380
There must be plenty of others willing
to help, even without payment.

00:20:33.380 --> 00:20:38.300
Well, if the Dark Dragon's gonna retire,

00:20:38.300 --> 00:20:41.010
the only suitable successor's
gotta be the Dark Lord, yeah?

00:20:44.850 --> 00:20:46.980
Your line of logic, I swear...

00:20:51.230 --> 00:20:52.980
What will you do from here on?

00:20:52.980 --> 00:20:56.530
Well, duh. I'm gonna keep lookin'.

00:20:56.530 --> 00:20:59.860
The world's a big ol' place.

00:20:59.860 --> 00:21:03.950
There's gotta be a place
out there for a dragon.

00:21:03.950 --> 00:21:04.870
You gonna--

00:21:04.870 --> 00:21:06.910
Yes, I'll come.

00:21:06.910 --> 00:21:13.000
You were right. All I know of this world
comes from the pages of a book.

00:21:13.000 --> 00:21:14.550
That is precisely why...

00:21:14.550 --> 00:21:19.590
I will see the world by assisting you
with your house-hunting.

00:21:19.590 --> 00:21:23.180
But only because it's convenient for me.

00:21:23.180 --> 00:21:24.890
That's rich.

00:21:26.270 --> 00:21:29.390
Perhaps I should pick up an
architect's license along the way.

00:21:29.390 --> 00:21:31.060
Not a bad idea.

00:21:34.190 --> 00:21:39.990
The next day, the headlines read "Dark
Dragon Serves as Dark Lord's Minion."

00:21:39.990 --> 00:21:43.160
Varney was quite upset.

00:21:45.120 --> 00:21:46.200
Letty?

00:21:46.200 --> 00:21:48.160
Yes?

00:21:48.160 --> 00:21:51.790
It's getting late. Let us continue
this story another time.

00:21:51.790 --> 00:21:54.710
Oh, good idea.

00:21:54.710 --> 00:21:57.170
I wonder what Varney ended up with.

00:21:57.170 --> 00:22:01.130
I bet his house is really cool.

00:22:01.130 --> 00:22:04.180
I hope I find one, too.

00:23:38.390 --> 00:23:39.390
Elf Housing Realty

00:23:39.390 --> 00:23:39.430
Elf Housing Realty

00:23:39.430 --> 00:23:39.480
Elf Housing Realty

00:23:39.650 --> 00:23:40.940
Welcome.

00:23:40.940 --> 00:23:44.650
I hope all of you are enjoying some rest
and relaxation in your own lovely homes.

00:23:44.650 --> 00:23:47.450
Next time, "Hunter Goes Dragon-Hunting."

00:23:47.610 --> 00:23:47.650
To be continued

00:23:47.650 --> 00:23:47.690
To be continued

00:23:47.690 --> 00:23:48.400
To be continued
